<Section id="what-it-is" num="01" title="What it is">
  <p class="prose">
    mandarinmaxxing is a skill for Claude that teaches Mandarin right in the chat. The words are the same as the
    official HSK. What changes is the order: instead of a list, you learn by situation. Saying hello, introducing
    yourself, ordering food, shopping.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    Each lesson teaches a few words inside phrases you can use right away, has you translate from your language into
    Mandarin with feedback on the spot, and brings older words back so you don’t forget them.
  </p>
  <p class="prose">
    No method is wrong. This is one option, for people who’d rather study this way.
  </p>
</Section>
